00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,000
Xi'an's Bell Tower, built 1384 — then shifted east.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Taken apart piece by piece, rebuilt on a new base.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,800
Double-tap if moving a whole landmark was worth it.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,500
Genius city planning, or Ming money to burn? Tell me.
